title <size:16>LLM-Based Vulnerability Scanning Workflow</size>

autonumber 1

participantgroup #lightblue <size:16>**Interface**</size>
    actor "<size:16>User</size>" as User
    boundary "<size:16>Frontend</size>" as Frontend
end

participantgroup #lightgreen <size:16>**Agent System**</size>
    boundary "<size:16>Agent Service</size>" as AgentService
    control "<size:16>Orchestrator</size>" as Orchestrator
    control "<size:16>File Selector Agent</size>" as FileSelector
    control "<size:16>Scan Agents</size>" as ScanAgents
    database "<size:16>A2A Task Store</size>" as Store
end

participantgroup #lightgray <size:16>**Repository**</size>
    entity "<size:16>Repository</size>" as Repository
end

participantgroup #lightyellow <size:16>**External Entity**</size>
    entity "<size:16>Chinou Models</size>" as Models
end

User->Frontend: <size:16>Provide repository name\nand custom prompt</size>
Frontend->AgentService: <size:16>POST /a2a\nStart security scan</size>

AgentService->Repository: <size:16>Clone repository</size>
Repository-->AgentService: <size:16>Return repository file index</size>

AgentService->Orchestrator: <size:16>Send file index</size>
Orchestrator->Store: <size:16>Store initial request\nand file index</size>
Store-->Orchestrator: <size:16>Return task ID</size>
Orchestrator-->AgentService: <size:16>Return task ID</size>
AgentService-->Frontend: <size:16>Return task ID</size>

Orchestrator->FileSelector: <size:16>Select potentially\nvulnerable files</size>
FileSelector->Models: <size:16>Identify and rank vulnerable files\nMaximum 50 files</size>
Models-->FileSelector: <size:16>Return ranked file list</size>
FileSelector-->Orchestrator: <size:16>Return top 50 files</size>
Orchestrator-->AgentService: <size:16>Return selected files</size>
AgentService-->Frontend: <size:16>Stream selected files\nand file content</size>

loop <size:16>For each scan agent\nRecon, Taint, Pattern, Logic and Deep Scan</size>
    par <size:16>For each selected file\n1 to 50</size>
        Orchestrator->ScanAgents: <size:16>Analyze file using\ncustom prompt</size>
        ScanAgents->Models: <size:16>Perform vulnerability analysis</size>
        Models-->ScanAgents: <size:16>Return findings</size>
        ScanAgents-->Orchestrator: <size:16>Return scan artifacts</size>

        Orchestrator->Store: <size:16>Store phase and file artifacts</size>
        Orchestrator-->AgentService: <size:16>Return phase result</size>
        AgentService-->Frontend: <size:16>Stream result for\nphase and file</size>
    end
end

Orchestrator->Store: <size:16>Store final scan results</size>
Orchestrator-->AgentService: <size:16>Return final scan results</size>
AgentService-->Frontend: <size:16>Stream scan completion</size>

Frontend->Frontend: <size:16>Generate vulnerability summary</size>
Frontend-->User: <size:16>Display vulnerabilities</size>
